        <body>
            <div xml:id="d431">

                <pb facs="0675" n="563" sameAs="frus:frus1907p1/pg563"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 4001/14.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Governor of Porto Rico
                        to the Secretary of State</hi>.</head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >San Juan de Porto Rico</hi></placeName>,<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-01-22"><hi rendition="#italic">January 22,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>I have been asked to ascertain present conditions Jamaica sufferers. Whether Red
                    Cross desire private subscriptions and form donations should take. Please cable
                    reply.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Beekman Winthrop.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
